## Maintenance

The Architect keeps this narration true to `profile/composeplatform-profile.yaml`. When a domain,
prefix, verb, or enum changes, edit the YAML first (the registry) and update this prose to match.
Humans do not hand-edit the corpus mechanics here — read this, change the profile.

